{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Screen Greens</strong> is a casual 2D side-view golf simulator that appears in a transparent window on your screen. Play and relax as you sink the ball into the hole with the fewest number of strokes on randomly generated levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcbb <strong>Transparent window:</strong> The game fits harmoniously into your workspace and does not distract you from other tasks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfcc\ufe0f\u200d\u2642\ufe0f <strong>Casual gameplay:</strong> Simple controls and an unobtrusive process make the game ideal for relaxation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf33 <strong>Random level generation:</strong> A new challenge awaits you on the course every time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26f3 <strong>Variety of locations:</strong> Play on different surfaces, from hills to sand bunkers and water hazards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u267e\ufe0f <strong>Endless gameplay:</strong> Enjoy the game at your own pace, without time limits or pressure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Collectibles:</strong> Unlock new balls, skins, and visual effects to make your game more colorful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb6 <strong>Pleasant music:</strong> A relaxing melody accompanies you throughout the game.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Hit!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3679570/c1902ea82eddaa6cdcc4979a6e909fb19be6068c.jpg"},{"name":"100 Hits!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3679570/16ad1e00e4b621d849de27bc452cc07d43d3afab.jpg"},{"name":"200 Hits!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3679570/2eddbfd76fd00248fe83fd2639548f84b3a9b19b.jpg"},{"name":"300 Hits!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/st